A vintage 1920s art deco diplomatic conference scene rendered in warm sepia and gold tones, featuring elegantly dressed anthropomorphic network cables and data packets seated around an ornate mahogany round table in a grand European palace hall. Crystal chandeliers cast soft amber light as the characters exchange formal scrolls and documents with wax seals. One figure, newer and slightly more modern-looking, enters through towering baroque doors while the established members turn with measured acknowledgment. Intricate geometric patterns frame the scene, suggesting the structured nature of protocols. The atmosphere conveys patient negotiation, tradition meeting gradual change, and the weight of establishing lasting agreements among long-standing peers.
